VioletCity_TrainerSchool_Text_Twin:
# 65 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "I'm not a Gba kid, but I love\n"
# 66 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "playing Pokémon games!\p"
# 67 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "In the old games, you had to battle\n"
# 68 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "a lot of wild Pokémon to get enough\l"
# 69 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "Exp.\p"
# 70 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "But in newer games, the Exp share\n"
# 71 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "makes your Pokémon level up too fast.\p"
# 72 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "In this game, the Exp share is\n"
# 73 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "balanced to put your Pokémon at just\l"
# 74 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "the right level. Or slightly higher,\l"
# 75 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "depending on how many battles you do.\p"
# 76 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "If you want a traditional Gen 1-4\n"
# 77 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "experience, turn Exp Share off.\l"
# 78 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "If you want a modern experience,\l"
# 79 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "turn Exp Share On.\p"
# 80 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"
	.string "You choose how you want to play!$"
# 81 "data/maps/VioletCity_TrainerSchool/scripts.pory"

